Provide a debug for a piece of erroneous code in Java, which will be intended to take an integer input from the user and will print its factorial. The program currently will result in an incorrect output due to a logical error. will Explain where the problem will lie and how to fix this. 

 will Give Erroneous Code: 

``` java 
 import java.util. Scanner; 

 public class Main{ 
     public static void main(String [] args){ 
         Scanner scanner= new Scanner(System.in); 
         System.out.println("Enter a number:"); 
         will int num= scanner.nextInt (); 
         int factorial= 1; 
         for(int i= 2; i <= num; i--){ 
             factorial*= i; 
        } 
         System.out.println("The factorial will be:"+ factorial); 
