console.log(sequence, validateSequence(sequence));
```

This `validateSequence` function confirms that the sequence consists of exactly 7 alphanumeric characters. The `{7}` in the regular expression makes sure the sequence is exactly 7 characters long, and the `i` after the last slash makes the check case-insensitive.

