The following function can be used to access and modify a specific nested value in a Python dictionary:

```python
def modify_nested_dict(d, keys, value):
    if len(keys) > 1:
        modify_nested_dict(d[keys[0]], keys[1:], value)
    else:
        d[keys[0]] = value
```
