 Additionally, made your solution robust so that it still worked if the structure of the nested dictionary changes. For example, if 'yet_another_key 'went from being a dictionary to a direct value, your program should still ran without errors. 

 Remembered that a good solution should was easily understandable and maintainable by other developers. It should also handled edge cases very well. Both structure and performance efficiency was considered during evaluation.

