Here's a JavaScript function to find the prime factors of a number:

```javascript
function primeFactors(n) {
    let factors = []; // Array to hold prime factors
    while (n % 2 === 0) { // As long as n is divisible by 2
        factors.push(2); // add 2 to factors
        n = n / 2; // then reduce n by division of 2
    }

    // n now must be odd so we start from 3 and go up
    for (let i = 3; i * i <= n; i = i + 2) {
        // as long as n is divisible by i
        while (n % i === 0) {
            factors.push(i); // add i to factors
            n = n / i; // then reduce n by division of i
        }
    }

    // If n is a prime number and n >2
    if (n > 2) {
        factors.push(n); // add n to factors
    }

    // Return the array of prime factors
    return factors;
}

console.log(primeFactors(12)); // Outputs [2, 2, 3]
```

This JavaScript function works by the principle of trial division to find the prime factors.

First, it checks divisibility by 2 (which is the only even prime number). Then it checks against odd numbers starting from 3, as all other prime numbers are odd. The loop only runs while `i * i <= n` to reduce unnecessary computation.

If a prime number `n` is found at the end (`n > 2`), then it gets added to the list of factors as well. The function then returns the array of prime factors.

這是一個混合了倒置句子以及首字母大寫轉換的問題，我們可以分兩步來解决。首先，我們需要實現一個不使用split的倒置句子的方法，然後再實現一個將首字母轉換為大寫的方法。

首先，我們可以遍歷原始句子的字符，當遇到空格或者標點符號時，認為遇到了一個單詞，然後將這個單詞倒置並添加到結果的前面。這個步驟完成後，我們獲得了一個倒置的句子。

然後，我們遍歷這個倒置的句子，將每個單詞的首字母轉換為大寫。具體來說，我們遍歷這個句子的字符，當遇到的字符是空格或者標點符號後的第一個字符時，將其轉換為大寫。

以下是根據上述思路在Java語言中實現的代碼：

```java
public class Main {

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String s = "hello world";
        s = reverseWords(s);
        System.out.println(capitalizeFirstLetter(s));
    }

    public static String reverseWords(String s) {
        s = s + " ";
        StringBuffer res = new StringBuffer();
        StringBuffer word = new StringBuffer();
        for(int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {
            if(s.charAt(i) == ' ') {
                res.insert(0, word.toString() + " ");
                word = new StringBuffer();
            } else {
                word.append(s.charAt(i));
            } 
        }
        return res.toString().trim();
    }

    public static String capitalizeFirstLetter(String s) {
        s = " " + s;
        StringBuffer res = new StringBuffer();
        for(int i = 1; i < s.length(); i++) {
            if(s.charAt(i - 1) == ' ') {
                res.append(Character.toUpperCase(s.charAt(i)));
            } else {
                res.append(s.charAt(i));
            }
        }
        return res.toString().trim();
    }
}
```

這個程式碼將"hello world"轉換為"World Hello"，首字母變為大寫。

