Now, we add an endpoint to our server which make a call to Recombee to get book recommendations for a particular user.

```javascript
app.get('/recommend/:userId', (req, res) => {
    rbcClient.send(
        new recombee.requests.RecommendItemsToUser(req.params.userId, 5),
        (err, recommended) => {
